<title>SRI LANKA: Tea Smallholder up on growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Tea Smallholder up on growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd rose 2.1 percent, or 50 cents to 24.50 rupees on buying of 14,500 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are bullish on the stock because tea prices have been near record highs so far in 1996,&quot; said a local trader.</p>
<p>The company processes tea bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
